Lore\" title=\"Spell Lore\">Kinetic Lore +24</a>:</b> Passive: Your Force, Physical and Untyped spells gain a 24% <a href=\"/page/Equipment_bonus\" title=\"Equipment bonus\">Equipment bonus</a> to their chance to critical hit.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Spell_Focus_Mastery\" title=\"Spell Focus Mastery\"> Spell Focus Mastery +8</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Spell_Focus_Mastery\" title=\"Spell Focus Mastery\"> Spell Focus Mastery +8</a>:</b> +8 Equipment bonus to the DC of all spells.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Sealed_in_Undeath\" title=\"Sealed in Undeath\">Sealed in Undeath</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Sealed_in_Undeath\" title=\"Sealed in Undeath\">Sealed in Undeath</a>:</b> This item seethes with a sealed power. It can have its power unsealed at the <a href=\"/page/Ritual_Table#Sealed_in_Undeath_clothing_/_jewelry_upgrades\" title=\"Ritual Table\">Ritual Table</a>, adding one effect. Attempting to add another will remove the original.<br /><br />Effect options: <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip no-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Strength\" title=\"Strength\"> Strength +15</a><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"tex